    "title": "Newton name to LBW Foundation Board - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Editor ,\n1 days ago Greenville Camellia Society President Jan Newton has been named to the Lurleen B. Wallace Community College Foundation Board. An active participant in many projects designed to improve her community, Newton is also an American Camellia Society member and accredited camellia show judge, a member of the Butler County Extension Master Gardener Association, and a member of the Butler County Historical & Genealogical Society. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
